        "CQ_S0_R1_0203"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0208"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0214"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceChunk "1qP3lsatCR_rag::chunk_004"^^xsd:string,
        "2401.08383_rag::chunk_012"^^xsd:string,
        "2407.04656_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "2407.04656_rag::chunk_010"^^xsd:string,
        "2408.04307_rag::chunk_004"^^xsd:string,
        "2411.15419_rag::chunk_005"^^xsd:string,
        "2412.14219_rag::chunk_016"^^xsd:string,
        "2503.04398_rag::chunk_001"^^xsd:string,
        "2504.19925_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "2505.08944_rag::chunk_001"^^xsd:string,
        "2505.11432_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "2506.12417_rag::chunk_005"^^xsd:string,
        "2509.09420_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "2510.02613_rag::chunk_004"^^xsd:string,
        "339caf45a6fa281cae8adc6465343464-Paper-Conference_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "EP partitions and computes experts in parallel across GPUs"^^xsd:string,
        "Expert parallelism ( EP ) [ 12 ] combines aspects of data parallelism and model parallelism to support MoE s."^^xsd:string,
        "Expert parallelism (EP) distributes experts across devices, with tokens dynamically routed to their assigned experts."^^xsd:string,
        "Expert parallelism is a key technique for deploying large MoE models across multiple devices to enable distributed execution."^^xsd:string,
        "Expert parallelism is a key technique for deploying large MoE models across multiple devices to enable distributed execution. As Figure 7 -(a) shown, when distributing MoE layers, each device holds a subset of experts"^^xsd:string,
        "Expert-parallelism Once the gating function determines expert assignments"^^xsd:string,
        "In expert parallel training, the experts of each layer are split into equal-sized chunks and allocated across multiple GPUs"^^xsd:string,
        "In the vanilla expert parallelism, each MoE layer strictly requires two Alltoall collectives"^^xsd:string,
        "In traditional expert parallelism, each token can be simply dispatched to the GPU that owns the corresponding expert"^^xsd:string,
        "Since the experts are distributed across different devices, communication during this process i"^^xsd:string,
        "To avoid the memory overhead of allocating a copy of every expert on every rank, systems use expert parallelism"^^xsd:string,
        "To avoid the memory overhead of allocating a copy of every expert on every rank, systems use expert parallelism [ 11 , 23 , 51 ]. As illustrated in Figure 1 , expert parallelism distributes experts across ranks (i.e., GPUs)."^^xsd:string,
        "With EP , the self-attention and router layers are replicated across GPUs (data parallelism), but each GPU only loads a subset of exp"^^xsd:string,
        "a notable distinction between EP and other parallelism is EPs flexibility in distributing diverse parameters across DP ranks."^^xsd:string,
        "cluster deployments favor Expert Parallelism (EP) to reduce inter-node communication"^^xsd:string,
        "cluster deployments favor Expert Parallelism (EP) to reduce inter-node communication, often replicating hot experts to improve load balance"^^xsd:string,
        "despite the cross-node expert parallelism common in existing systems"^^xsd:string,
        "expert parallelism (EP) [ 17 ] has been proposed and has become the de facto approach to train large-scale MoE models."^^xsd:string,
        "expert parallelism [6], [5] has been proposed as a novel hybrid parallelism dedicated to MoE by exploiting its unique features"^^xsd:string,
        "expert parallelism distributes experts across ranks (i.e., GPUs). Each rank hosts a fixed number of expert slots"^^xsd:string,
        "shard experts across GPUs to fit large MoE models (expert parallelism)."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :model_parallelism,
        owl:Thing ;
    owl:disjointWith :tensor_parallelism ;
    skos:altLabel "Expert-Parallelism"^^xsd:string,
        "ExpertParallelism"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A parallelism strategy that combines aspects of data parallelism and model parallelism to support MoE models by partitioning and computing experts in parallel across GPUs."^^xsd:string ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom "CQ_S0_R1_0004"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0009"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0043"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0048"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0053"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0058"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0059"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0088"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0107"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0114"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0119"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0142"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0149"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0160"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0164"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0171"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0180"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0198"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0203"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0208"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0214"^^xsd:string .

