    kg:docId "2201.05596_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2201_05596_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "loss and the standard LM loss towards the end of training, due to under-tting. In contrast, our proposed staged-KD is able to resolve this issue and brings the promised benets from KD. Overall, the distilled MoE model through staged KD achieves an average accuracy of 42.87 and 47.96, retaining 99.5% and 99.1% performance of the 350M (43.08) and 1.3B teacher model (48.37) despite having 12.5% fewer layers. This enables an additional latency reduction and throughput reduction for inference, which " .

