    kg:textSpan "sparse parameters takes place through the PCIe bandwidth in the vertical dimension of the device. Given that sparse parameters are stored in SSDs, we mitigate access to SSDs for sparse parameter states by implementing a cache mechanism in the CPU memory, akin to the LFU (Least Frequently Used) mechanism [50]. CPU caches are responsible for storing selectively activated sparse parameter states used in FWD/BWD calculations and parameter updates. When a prefetch request is received, it is prioritiz" .

