    kg:textSpan "assigned to it. The token distribution mechanism is simplified with less complexity, and the communication and computation are reduced. V. D YNAMIC G ATING O PTIMIZATION The observed activation patterns demonstrate a distinct gap between assumptions in system design and inference performance. Naively increasing expert capacity may still not prevent token overflow for some experts, but will create extra redundancy and waste for other experts. While previous studies also notice the imbalanced acti" .

