    kg:textSpan "designed for scaling experts is no longer well suited for this new strategy. On the contrary, our scheme is designed to scale both the backbone and experts, which is more exible and congurable. 3 M ODEL A RCHITECTURE 3.1 P RELIMINARY : P ARALLEL AND M O E 3.1.1 B ASICS OF T RANSFORMER In this paper, we take the decoder-only transformer architecture as an example to instantiate the proposed architecture. In a densely connected transformer, a batch of sequences with s tokens is rst mapped to a ten" .

