    kg:textSpan "guaranteed by tensor parallel. Hidden embeddings are then fed to the gating module and generate the dispatching order. Since all inputs, parameters, and algorithms are exactly the same, the dispatching order on each rank is also identical. Then token embeddings are dispatched to their corresponding experts according to the dispatching order by an index selection operation. After processed by related experts, token embeddings are gathered by an all-reduce communication, nishing forward computing " .

