    kg:textSpan "1 ), and the 5th and 8th on expert 0 ( E 0 ). Since X is on all ranks of the tensor-parallel group, we can dispatch token embeddings to corresponding experts by X 0 = X [[4 , 7] , ... ] , X 1 = X [2 , ... ] , X 2 = X [[0 , 3 , 6] , ... ] and X 3 = X [[1 , 5] , ... ] . After processed by corresponding experts, output embeddings are rst gathered inside each tensor parallel rank by index assignment and then collected by an all-reduce communication across the tensor parallel group. A PyTorch-like ps" .

