    kg:textSpan "scaled with pipeline parallel like those dense models do Narayanan et al. (2021). From a layer-wise view, an MoE layer can be easily replaced by a non-MoE FFN without dramatically changing its input/output format and communication pattern. In other words, a dense model powered by tensor parallel and pipeline parallel can be seamlessly transformed into an MoE model by just replacing some of those FFNs with MoE layers build with our proposed expert parallel. Scaling MoE models with pipeline parall" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2308_12066_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
