    kg:textSpan "of the last MoE layer for simplicity, as we validate that other MoE layers have similar distribution. At the onset of training, the model exhibits a highly skewed distribution, indicative of a pronounced imbalance among experts, which matches the result in other studies [ 13 ]. However, as the training advances, a more uniform and balanced distribution is observed. This is also reflected in Fig 12a , where we measure the expert affinity by solving formula 8 at different iterations of the trainin" .

