    kg:textSpan "we set the coefficient of router entropy loss as 3 10 2 . Limitation While our study highlights the substantial benefits of HMoE, several pathways for enhancement and exploration remain. Firstly, our initial experiments have yielded promising results, especially with increased training FLOPs. We anticipate even greater efficacy and scalability with larger datasets and models. Future work will focus on validating these effects on a larger scale and conducting more comprehensive analyses. Secondly" .

