    kg:textSpan "detailed analysis is provided in the Appendix A.4 . 3 E XPERIMENTS In this section, we experimentally analyze the performance of our proposed method. First, in 3.2 we benchmark our approach against a dense LLM trained using regular distributed training techniques. Second, in 3.3 , we evaluate our method on downstream tasks, demonstrating that it achieves performance comparable to baseline models at the same level of perplexity, improving upon a dense model given the total training FLOPs spent. F" .

