    kg:textSpan "layer become active, LRU would result in constant expert swapping. However, PLEC can use the predicted routing path to prefetch all 8 experts from the first two layers, fully utilizing the cache and avoiding unnecessary data transfers. As the computation of the first layer completes, PLEC asynchronously prefetches experts for the third layer, reducing I/O overhead and improving throughput. Batch-level Batch1 New Batch1 Routing Path New Batch2 Batch2 OrignalExpert Loads Activate all expertsper ba" .

