    kg:textSpan "an artifact of measurement. Identifying permanently underutilized experts is quite challenging and requires prior knowledge of the workload. The strong batch-level skew in expert activation hints at the possibility of dynamic expert management during serving time to reduce decode latency. This finding challenges our basic assumptions about MoE operation. The model doesnt actually need equal contribution from all selected experts it relies heavily on primary selections while maintaining substanti" .

