    kg:textSpan "Maximizing Compute Efficiency 5.3 Load Balancing: Coordinating Distributed Resources GPU utilization in distributed MoE systems is fundamentally limited by the mismatch between expert routing patterns and hardware resource distribution. Traditional approaches either over-provision resources to handle worst-case scenarios or suffer from resource fragmentation when routing patterns change. PiKV addresses this challenge through compute-aware routing and dynamic resource allocation. Figure 11 (top-l" .

