    kg:textSpan "that enables sequence-sharding in MoE blocks to address the activation memory bottleneck, with topologyaware planning and device-mapping. Together, these optimizations form an integrated and cross-platform training system that scales emerging MoEs on large scale HPC clusters. The following sections provide an in-depth description of each design. 3.3 Expensive All-to-All on HPC Platform with Heterogeneous and Hierarchical Network Most prior MoE training systems were designed for clusters composed" .

