    kg:textSpan "each token at inference time. One way to realize this idea is by introducing controlled variation within each transformer block (Shelmanov et al., 2021) and recomputing the layer output multiple times. Another approach is to reuse each layer repeatedly in a recurrent manner, thereby increasing computation without adding parameters (Lin et al., 2022). While many variants are possible, we focus on sparsely activated Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) models, which provide an ideal architecture for implement" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2509_17238_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
