    kg:textSpan "In our experiments (Section 3), we employ the Tree-structured Parzen Estimator (TPE) Watanabe (2023) via the Optuna framework Akiba et al. (2019). To make the search tractable for models with many MoE layers, we introduce two heuristics to prune the vast search space, based on empirical observations: 1. Apply RoE to middle layers only. We hypothesize that the initial and final layers of a transformer are more sensitive to routing perturbations. The initial layers process raw token embeddings, wh" .

