    kg:docId "2510.13079_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2510_13079_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "expert similarity, increases selection entropy, and maintains diversity patterns, with particularly significant improvements in deeper layers where expert specialization is most critical. 2 Related Work Sparse MoE and routing. MoE architectures scale model capacity through sparse activation and learned routing. As a foundational contribution, Shazeer et al. [ 25 ] introduced sparsely-gated layers with token-choice routing. Building on this, Switch Transformer [ 15 ] simplified the original desig" .

