    kg:textSpan "the same set of layers, and the compression ratios are also the same. For the M-SMoE, although it describes a way to adjust the compression ratios of each layer, we found in our evaluations that it may lead to much worse results. Therefore, we simply fix the compression ratios for all layers to be consistent, and we believe it is still a fair setting. 5.2 P ERFORMANCE OF M ERGE M O E We compare the performance of MergeMoE with baseline algorithms on three MoE models. For the evaluation on the Qw" .

