    kg:textSpan "introduce QMoE, a framework for accurate compression and fast inference over massive MoEs, reducing model sizes by 1020 , to less than 1 bit per parameter. QMoE is specifically designed to compress and subsequently inference with models like the 1.6 trillion parameter SwitchTransformer-c2048, using only modest computational resources. MoE Layer FC Block 1 Tokens Our key technical contributions are a highly scalable compression algorithm implementation and a customized compression format designed" .

