    kg:textSpan "and GLaM [ 15 ], shard experts across GPUs to fit large MoE models (expert parallelism). In such sharded deployment, GPUs in charge of cold experts will get lower loads and will be stalling while waiting for the slowest expert to finish. In addition to GPU stalls, expert load skew also hurts GPU efficiency by preventing layers executions at optimal batch 1 Introduction It is well known that the accuracy of a DNN (including LLM) is dependent on the model size [ 9 ], so high-performance models [ 2" .

