    kg:textSpan "concurrently. Within each replica, Tensor parallelism (TP) shards large matrix operations (typically attention operations) across devices to reduce memory load. Expert parallelism (EP) distributes experts across devices, with tokens dynamically routed to their assigned experts. A common configuration sets EP = TP DP , 3 Opportunities and Key Insights LLM serving systems deployed in production must elastically scale to handle dynamic and often unpredictable workloads while maintaining strict perf" .

