    kg:textSpan "routed experts, we propose a Progressive Scaling Routing (PSR) strategy for training. An overview of R E XM O E is shown in Figure 1 . 3 3.1 R EVIEW OF T OP K R OUTING M IXTURE OF -E XPERTS In a standard L -layer transformer-based Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture, the Feed-Forward Network (FFN) blocks are replaced with MoE blocks, each comprising N experts and a router. The candidate expert pool of layer- l , E l = { E 1 , E 2 , . . . , E N } , consists of N experts, each instantiated as an" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2511_02237_rag__chunk_013> a kg:Chunk ;
