    kg:docId "2511.14102_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2511_14102_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "aggregate bandwidth for host-device data transfers. Additionally, we select several representative GPU memory budgets to evaluate how system performance is affected under varying degrees of memory constraints. 4.1.2 Implementation Details. Our system is built upon the Hugging Face Transformers framework for inference and utilizes GPTQ [ 13 ] for the quantization of draft models. To enable efficient asynchronous execution between communication and computation, we employ CUDA multistream schedulin" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2511_16947_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
