    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2201_05596_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "low latency. In this section, we explore how these two broad goals of high throughput and low latency can be realized for MoE model inference at scale. We also explore how MoE model inference is dierent compared to their dense counterparts. The key questions we try to explore include: 1) What are the unique properties of MoE inference? 2) How does it perform and scale with increased model size and resources? 3) What kind of benets do model optimizations like PR-MoE and MoS bring for MoE model in" .

